Package: SERO
Title: Spatial Emergency Response Optimization
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Prince Oppong Boakye [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Prince Oppong Boakye <prynx44@gmail.com>
Authors@R: c(
    person("Prince", "Oppong Boakye", email = "prynx44@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Spatial emergency response optimization for accident analysis in Muenster, Germany.
    Identifies accident hotspots using robust point pattern analysis, computes optimal emergency service locations with multi-criteria analysis, and visualizes accident density and hotspots. All analysis uses built-in data from the inst/gpkg folder. The codebase is now streamlined and focused on core spatial workflows, with obsolete and empty files removed for clarity and maintainability.
